- **Concern**: Plan does not require $BUG_TMPDIR under canonical /tmp. Scenario: Step 2 only says setup $BUG_TMPDIR while frontmatter adds deny-edit-write.sh; Write to $BUG_TMPDIR/bug-issue-body.md is denied if tmpdir is under ~/.cache or the repo
- **Proposed resolution**: In Step 2 mandate mktemp -d under /tmp (mirror skills/issue/SKILL.md ISSUE_TMPDIR pattern) and state all Write paths must stay under that directory

